password_screen = NodePath("Laptop_password")
password_email = NodePath("Laptop_email")
email_draft = "Hey dad, 
Sorry for leaving you and mom in the dark, It's just that ever since ive moved into this house ive been getting this uneasy feeling. Something about this place has me drawing a blank, like the place itself is squeezing the thoughts right out of my head. I can't explain it, but something about it just doesn't feel right.

But I think Isabell is having a worse time. I don't know if it's the new environment or the house itself, but she's been spending more and more time writing in her journal. Isolating herself in the basement and…. 
[The rest of the email is left blank]"
email_dad = "Michael, I’ve been trying to reach out to you recently, I’m starting to get worried about you. Ever since you moved we’ve talked less and less… I know that life gets in the way but I need you to at least respond to my letters, before I start thinking that house of yours ate you alive!

From,
Dad"
